sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant N as Next.js routes
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant X as Marble FAL ElevenLabs
  participant S as Stripe
  U->>N: GET blob upload signed URL
  U->>N: POST api scenes with photo URL
  N-->>U: 201 scene with slug
  N->>P: scene uploaded event
  P->>X: submit Marble world and poll
  X-->>P: spz URL full and low poly
  P->>X: Hunyuan3D meshes and ambient sfx
  P->>N: update scene status ready
  U->>N: POST stripe checkout
  N->>S: create checkout session
  S->>N: webhook after hosted payment completes
  N->>N: mark processed then mark paid
  U->>N: GET scene page
  N-->>U: paid scene with splat and audio URLs
